{"meta":{"id":"tt5822536","type":"movie","name":"Paddington: Aventura en la selva","description":"Paddington viaja a Perú para visitar a su querida tía Lucy, que ahora reside en el Hogar de Osos Jubilados. Con la familia Brown a cuestas, se desata una emocionante aventura cuando un misterio los sumerge en un viaje inesperado a través de la selva amazónica y hasta las cimas de las montañas de Perú.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/mlqvgdzoFkUULsQtXFkO7xHLFqF.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7N7CtZftqEvgojR3QloukU0oWPg.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hBKXDeWSznMFQCSjXmr8ah0URkL.png","genres":["Aventura","Comedia","Familia"],"releaseInfo":"2024","released":"2024-11-08T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"6.8","runtime":"106 min","trailers":[{"source":"xAVaoYfOCrU","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Ben Whishaw","Hugh Bonneville","Emily Mortimer","Samuel Joslin","Madeleine Harris","Antonio Banderas","Carla Tous","Olivia Colman","Julie Walters","Imelda Staunton","Jim Broadbent","Hayley Atwell","Oliver Maltman","Joel Fry","Robbie Gee"],"director":["Dougal Wilson"],"writer":["James Lamont","Jon Foster","Mark Burton"],"links":[{"name":"Ben Whishaw","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Ben%20Whishaw"},{"name":"Hugh Bonneville","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Hugh%20Bonneville"},{"name":"Emily Mortimer","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Emily%20Mortimer"},{"name":"Samuel Joslin","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Samuel%20Joslin"},{"name":"Madeleine Harris","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Madeleine%20Harris"},{"name":"Antonio Banderas","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Antonio%20Banderas"},{"name":"Carla Tous","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Carla%20Tous"},{"name":"Olivia Colman","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Olivia%20Colman"},{"name":"Julie Walters","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Julie%20Wal